{"id": "86349", "name": "גבול סדרה – a·cos((2n−1)π/2), סדרת אפסים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find the limit, as \\(n\\) tends to plus infinity, of the following sequence, if a limit exists:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a_{n} = {{CT:0}} \\cos\\left(\\frac{(2 n -1) \\pi}{2}\\right) . \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">limit = [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">If no limit exists, enter 11111.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">All the terms are zero</b><br>In the sequence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a_{n} = {{CT:0}} \\cos\\left(\\frac{(2 n -1) \\pi}{2}\\right) . \\]</p>for every \\(n\\) the angle \\(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi}{2}\\) is an odd multiple of \\(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\) (\\(\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\ \\frac{3\\pi}{2},\\ \\frac{5\\pi}{2},\\ldots\\)), and the cosine of such an angle is \\(0\\). Hence \\(a_{n} = 0\\) for all \\(n\\): the sequence is constant, therefore the limit is equal to 0:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lim_{n\\to\\infty} a_n = 0 \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "limit", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode